# D1-05-007 snapshot 冻结意图（定义时）
# doc: docs/syntax/07_behavior_expressions.md §7.4 snapshot + 09_intent_system.md §9.2
# 期望: snapshot 定义时冻结意图；调用时不受后续意图影响

@+ 聚焦于正面回答
fn handler = snapshot -> str: @~ 根据 $context 生成回复 ~
@-

str context = "今天天气"
str reply1 = handler()
print("reply1=" + reply1)

@! 只输出：REJECTED
str reply2 = handler()
print("reply2=" + reply2)
print("DONE")
